OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA mild and wet start, skies
OL,6,Fslowly clearing from the north from
OL,7,Flate morning. Chance of some showers
OL,8,Fdeveloping during the afternoon along
OL,9,Fthe Kent coast.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FSkies clearing and becoming
OL,12,Fdrier and settled in the west,
OL,13,Fremaining cloudy in the east. Winds
OL,14,Fgenerally light but breezy along the
OL,15,Fcoast.
OL,16,
OL,17,CSaturday:FClear skies in the west at
OL,18,Ffirst then turning increasingly cloudy
OL,19,Fwith some occasional showers moving
OL,20,Finto Kent during the afternoon, Winds
OL,21,Fbecoming breezy from late morning.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
